he live invoice residual. Use regular credit notes for corrections. Reset to draft and reverse-and-recreate are blocked after contract transfers.</div><field name="cra_retention_ids" readonly="1"/><field name="cra_movement_ids" readonly="1"/></page></xpath></field></record></odoo>
